OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer who called 999 saw 'large
OL,4,Agroup of hooded and masked men' near
OL,5,ARAF Fairford, she tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FRAF Fairford, which is in the
OL,8,FCotswolds, is used by the US military.
OL,9,FPresident Trump says the US had the
OL,10,Ffive men "under view for a long time,
OL,11,Fand we got them"
